ENGLISH
=============================================================================

The source code of Rembobine is made public so that it can be READ and
studied. It is NOT open-source or free software.

Without the prior written permission of grecdel, you may not:
  - copy all or part of this code, its images, texts or sounds;
  - modify, adapt, translate it or create derivative works from it;
  - redistribute, publish, sell, rent or otherwise make it available,
    whether free of charge or not.

You may:
  - read and view this code on the site where it is published;
  - download and use, for personal and private purposes, the releases of
    Rembobine published by grecdel (the repository's "Releases" page).

Third-party software: Rembobine ships with software written by others
(for example EmulatorJS and its libretro cores, PCSX2, RPCS3, xemu, Xenia,
PPSSPP, FFmpeg, mpv, Electron/Chromium, Godot, SDL2 and, in the Rembobine OS
image, Raspberry Pi OS, RetroArch, Samba, Tailscale…). Each of them keeps
ITS OWN LICENSE, which applies to it alone and is not changed by this
license. The full list, with each license and the address of each source
code, is in the application: Paramètres → À propos → "Crédits et licences".
The texts of these licenses are shipped in the application's "licences"
folder.

Rembobine is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. To ask for
permission: open an issue on the Rembobine GitHub repository.
